+    2. `TypeError: Cannot set properties of undefined (setting 'selectedYoinkMarkdown')` because lexical `const state` and `const els` inside `<script>` do not attach to `ctx` in Node's `vm.runInContext()`.
+- **Diagnosis**:
+  - The Node harness attempted to evaluate the full `<script>` block including `init().catch()` at the bottom of `index.html`. `init()` triggers DOM interactions (`classList.toggle`, `setAttribute`).
