+- **Precise Repair**:
+  - In `tests/test_native_note_display_regressions.py`, slice `scriptCode` to stop right before `init().catch(`, preventing asynchronous startup side-effects.
+  - Added `toggle`, `setAttribute`, and `getAttribute` to mock DOM element definitions.
+  - Added `globalThis.state = state; globalThis.els = els;` to the evaluated script so test assertions can configure and inspect UI state.
