+## 4. Behavioral Verification Summary
+
+1. **Media Labels (Defect 1)**:
+   - Native notes (`source_type="note"`, `platform="note"`) display `"note"` and `"Saved note source."` (no `"note video"`).
+   - Text-only fixtures (`source_type="note"`, `platform="x"`) display `"note"` (no `"x video"`).
+   - Canonical types (`image`, `page`, `x_article`, `x_thread`, `reddit_thread`, `podcast`, `video`, `live stream`) preserve correct source-specific labels.
+
+2. **Note Detail Panels (Defect 1 & 3)**:
+   - Screenshot grid and screenshot placeholder are omitted for notes (`mediaBody = ""`).
+   - Re-transcription action button is disabled for notes with tooltip `"Re-transcription is not applicable for notes."`.
+   - Facts panel omits `Duration`, `Speakers`, `Transcript checker`, and `Re-transcription` for notes.
+   - Note file displays as `"Note file"` with status `"ready"`.
+   - Saved details displays `"ready"` without hanging on `"checking saved files"` or attempting failed `/file` HTTP 415 requests.
+
+3. **Asset Health & Spurious Needs Attention (Defect 2)**:
+   - Notes with valid text content evaluate health as `{"transcript": "ok", "screenshots": "skipped", "comments": "skipped", ...}`.
+   - Clean note saves produce no `"Needs attention"` badge in card or detail views.
+   - Real applicable failures (missing or empty note body text) continue to trigger `transcript: "missing"` and display `"Needs attention"`.
+   - Full video and podcast asset health checking is completely preserved.
+
+4. **Security & Containment**:
+   - File-path containment in `_resolve_served_file()` remains untouched.
+   - `/file` continues to strictly refuse non-image MIME types with 415 and traversal paths with 403.
+   - Zero live index access, zero external network requests, zero paid API invocations.
